Fonts (assets/fonts/)
---------------------
Source Serif 4 (variable, Latin subset) and Source Sans 3 (variable, Latin subset): the Latin
subsets that Fontsource publishes as version 5.3.0 of the @fontsource-variable/source-serif-4
and @fontsource-variable/source-sans-3 packages (the packages give Google Inc. as their author),
bundled unmodified.

